{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/9118aedf5d75d918749417fd2caade21.avif?t=1769100704\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras_big/9118aedf5d75d918749417fd2caade21.webp?t=1769100704 width=1560 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hovercrafts x nihilism is a vehicular shooter inspired by shadow of the colossus set in a post apocalyptic world devastated by war and natural disasters. Pilot your craft as a young revolutionary tasked with recovering an ancient power on a distant planet as your revolution collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Details:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/cdff920851755c7a5b28afa80732a922.poster.avif?t=1769100704\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/cdff920851755c7a5b28afa80732a922.webm?t=1769100704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/cdff920851755c7a5b28afa80732a922.mp4?t=1769100704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a desolate world in your hovercraft, navigating through landscapes and discovering its secrets at your own pace.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piloting your ship is deliberate, fast, and unwieldy, rewarding mastery as you navigate the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift through haunting low-poly landscapes, cruise around massive structures, and encounter towering, otherworldly entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights require a mixture of careful driving and precise aim, to avoid huge attacks all while attacking from your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Techno music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867360?t=1769100704","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867360?t=1769100704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/0f1409dfb48451ee3a48c835427348fc1f097d18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769100704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/0f1409dfb48451ee3a48c835427348fc1f097d18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769100704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4323850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/9118aedf5d75d918749417fd2caade21.avif?t=1769100704\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras_big/9118aedf5d75d918749417fd2caade21.webp?t=1769100704 width=1560 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hovercrafts x nihilism is a vehicular shooter inspired by shadow of the colossus set in a post apocalyptic world devastated 